WEBVTT

00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:04.327
The ticket inspector.

00:00:04.387 --> 00:00:07.932
Coffee.

00:00:07.992 --> 00:00:11.798
No thanks.

00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:16.203
Seats for dinner.

00:00:16.264 --> 00:00:20.499
No thanks.

00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:26.214
No, thanks.

00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:28.495
I don't want a ticket, thank you.

00:00:28.555 --> 00:00:30.426
I'm not selling tickets, sir.

00:00:30.486 --> 00:00:31.056
No?

00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:32.006
No?

00:00:32.066 --> 00:00:34.337
I want to see your ticket.

00:00:34.397 --> 00:00:36.018
Oh, I haven't got a ticket.

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:37.248
You haven't got a ticket?

00:00:37.308 --> 00:00:38.739
No, I never buy a ticket.

00:00:38.799 --> 00:00:39.890
Why not?

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.971
Well, they are very expensive, you know.

00:00:43.031 --> 00:00:46.137
Sir, you're travelling on a train.

00:00:46.198 --> 00:00:51.905
When people travel on a train, they always buy a ticket.

00:00:51.965 --> 00:00:55.506
And this is a first-class compartment.

00:00:55.566 --> 00:00:56.396
Yes.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.857
It is very nice, isn't it?

00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:00.208
No, sir.

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:03.979
I mean, this is a first-class compartment.

00:01:04.039 --> 00:01:10.942
When people travel in a first-class compartment, they always buy a first-class ticket.

00:01:11.002 --> 00:01:12.100
No, they don't.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:13.048
What?

00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:15.259
A lot of people don't buy tickets.

00:01:15.319 --> 00:01:17.481
The Queen doesn't buy a ticket, does she, eh?

00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:18.042
Eh?

00:01:18.102 --> 00:01:19.452
No, sir.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.104
But she's a famous person.

00:01:22.164 --> 00:01:23.116
What about you?

00:01:23.176 --> 00:01:24.076
Where's yours?

00:01:24.136 --> 00:01:24.807
Mine?

00:01:24.867 --> 00:01:25.617
Yes, yours.

00:01:25.677 --> 00:01:26.288
Your ticket.

00:01:26.348 --> 00:01:27.429
Have you got a ticket?

00:01:27.489 --> 00:01:28.230
Me, sir.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:29.020
Yes, you.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.572
No, I haven't got a ticket.

00:01:31.632 --> 00:01:34.029
Are you a famous person?

00:01:34.088 --> 00:01:35.404
Famous?

00:01:35.464 --> 00:01:37.475
Well, not very...

00:01:37.535 --> 00:01:40.086
Sir, I am a ticket inspector.

00:01:40.146 --> 00:01:42.438
I inspect tickets.

00:01:42.498 --> 00:01:44.749
Are you going to show me your ticket?

00:01:44.809 --> 00:01:45.420
No.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.070
I haven't got a ticket.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:48.692
I see.

00:01:48.752 --> 00:01:50.162
What are you going to do?

00:01:50.222 --> 00:01:53.154
I'm going to write your name in my book.

00:01:53.214 --> 00:01:54.755
Oh.

00:01:54.815 --> 00:01:57.186
What is your name, sir?

00:01:57.246 --> 00:01:58.907
Mickey Mouse.

00:01:58.967 --> 00:02:01.678
Mickey...

00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:03.019
A mouse.

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:06.371
M-O-U-S-E.

00:02:06.431 --> 00:02:08.582
Your name, sir.

00:02:08.642 --> 00:02:09.973
Karl Marx?

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:11.824
William Shakespeare?

00:02:11.884 --> 00:02:13.545
Charles Dickens?

00:02:13.605 --> 00:02:15.376
I see, sir.

00:02:15.436 --> 00:02:20.429
Well, if you're not going to tell me your name, please leave the train.

00:02:20.489 --> 00:02:21.069
Pardon?

00:02:21.129 --> 00:02:22.440
Leave the train.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.090
I can't.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:23.911
You can't watch.

00:02:23.971 --> 00:02:24.871
I can't leave the train.

00:02:24.931 --> 00:02:25.482
Why not?

00:02:25.541 --> 00:02:26.852
It's moving.

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:30.402
Not now, sir, at the next station.

00:02:30.462 --> 00:02:31.833
No.

00:02:31.893 --> 00:02:33.904
It's in the book, sir.

00:02:33.964 --> 00:02:37.986
When you travel by train, you buy a ticket.

00:02:38.046 --> 00:02:41.518
And if you don't buy a ticket, you leave the train.

00:02:41.538 --> 00:02:43.589
Leave the train.

00:02:43.649 --> 00:02:45.920
Here we are, sir.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.791
We're coming to a station.

00:02:47.851 --> 00:02:49.092
Please.

00:02:49.152 --> 00:02:50.793
Leave the train now.

00:02:50.852 --> 00:02:51.823
Now?

00:02:51.883 --> 00:02:52.944
Yes, sir.

00:02:53.004 --> 00:02:54.254
I'm sorry, but...

00:02:54.314 --> 00:02:55.005
Oh, that's okay.

00:02:55.025 --> 00:02:56.128
It's in the book.

00:02:56.188 --> 00:02:57.692
What did you say?

00:02:57.752 --> 00:03:00.393
I said, that's OK.

00:03:00.453 --> 00:03:02.104
OK.

00:03:02.164 --> 00:03:02.844
Yes.

00:03:02.904 --> 00:03:04.514
This is my station.

00:03:04.574 --> 00:03:08.736
Goodbye.

00:03:08.796 --> 00:03:13.297
The restaurant.

00:03:13.357 --> 00:03:15.958
Let's go to a restaurant tonight.

00:03:16.018 --> 00:03:16.838
OK.

00:03:16.898 --> 00:03:18.529
Somewhere different.

00:03:18.589 --> 00:03:19.809
All right.

00:03:19.869 --> 00:03:23.475
Let's have a look in the newspaper.

00:03:23.535 --> 00:03:34.522
and cinemas, theatres, restaurants.

00:03:34.582 --> 00:03:38.354
Ooh, this sounds nice.

00:03:38.414 --> 00:03:43.615
London's newest restaurant, the Trattoria Romantica.

00:03:43.675 --> 00:03:44.936
It sounds good.

00:03:44.996 --> 00:03:50.595
The Trattoria Romantica, the best French restaurant in London.

00:03:50.655 --> 00:03:51.714
French.

00:03:51.774 --> 00:03:52.736
Yes.

00:03:52.796 --> 00:03:55.580
Tres a real romantica sounds Italian.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.532
It says French here.

00:03:57.592 --> 00:04:00.008
What else does it say?

00:04:00.068 --> 00:04:02.914
Open every evening.

00:04:02.974 --> 00:04:03.654
Good.

00:04:03.714 --> 00:04:07.667
From 7.30 to 7.45.

00:04:07.727 --> 00:04:08.318
What?

00:04:08.378 --> 00:04:09.499
15 minutes.

00:04:09.559 --> 00:04:10.750
It must be a mistake.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:11.830
I hope so.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.472
Anything else?

00:04:13.532 --> 00:04:15.084
Yes.

00:04:15.144 --> 00:04:16.975
Music every evening.

00:04:17.035 --> 00:04:17.766
Good.

00:04:17.825 --> 00:04:20.197
From our Spanish guitarist.

00:04:20.257 --> 00:04:21.748
Spanish guitarist.

00:04:21.808 --> 00:04:23.540
Manfred Schmidt.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.961
Manfred Schmidt.

00:04:25.021 --> 00:04:26.548
Yes.

00:04:26.608 --> 00:04:30.134
Oh, and there's a picture of the manager.

00:04:30.194 --> 00:04:31.425
What's his name?

00:04:31.485 --> 00:04:33.396
Stavros Papadopoulos.

00:04:33.456 --> 00:04:35.107
Stavros Papadopoulos?

00:04:35.167 --> 00:04:35.707
Yes.

00:04:35.767 --> 00:04:37.067
But that's a Greek name.

00:04:37.087 --> 00:04:37.898
Yes.

00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:42.050
So, it's an Italian restaurant serving French food.

00:04:42.109 --> 00:04:46.612
The Spanish guitarist has got a German name and the manager's Greek.

00:04:46.672 --> 00:04:47.792
That's right.

00:04:47.852 --> 00:04:49.963
It sounds very international.

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:51.394
Let's try it.

00:04:51.454 --> 00:04:53.713
Alright.

00:04:53.772 --> 00:04:56.671
Well, here we are.

00:04:56.731 --> 00:04:59.092
The Tratoria Romantica.

00:04:59.152 --> 00:05:00.392
There's no one here.

00:05:00.412 --> 00:05:04.164
Hello!

00:05:04.224 --> 00:05:06.214
Yes?

00:05:06.274 --> 00:05:07.754
Oh, good evening.

00:05:07.814 --> 00:05:10.295
Is this the Tratoria Romantica?

00:05:10.355 --> 00:05:11.285
I don't know.

00:05:11.345 --> 00:05:12.795
I only work here.

00:05:12.855 --> 00:05:13.786
Pardon?

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:15.036
Yes, yes, yes.

00:05:15.096 --> 00:05:18.167
This is the Tratoria Romantica.

00:05:18.227 --> 00:05:19.806
But we're closed for lunch.

00:05:19.866 --> 00:05:21.406
Closed for lunch.

00:05:21.466 --> 00:05:23.858
But it's nine o'clock.

00:05:23.918 --> 00:05:26.860
In that case, we're closed for breakfast.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.091
It's nine o'clock in the evening.

00:05:29.151 --> 00:05:31.702
Yes, of course it is.

00:05:31.762 --> 00:05:33.553
Just a little joke.

00:05:33.613 --> 00:05:36.194
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:05:36.254 --> 00:05:42.018
I am Stavros Papadopoulos, the manager of the Trutteria Romantica.

00:05:42.078 --> 00:05:44.009
What can I do for you?

00:05:44.069 --> 00:05:46.360
We'd like a table for two, please.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.912
Have you got a reservation?

00:05:48.972 --> 00:05:50.268
No.

00:05:50.328 --> 00:05:52.896
Ah, that's a problem.

00:05:52.956 --> 00:05:55.187
But the restaurant is empty.

00:05:55.247 --> 00:05:56.457
Is it?

00:05:56.517 --> 00:05:59.168
Oh yes.

00:05:59.228 --> 00:06:02.770
A table for two.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:07.441
Yes, here are a lovely table for two.

00:06:07.501 --> 00:06:10.012
Thank you.

00:06:10.072 --> 00:06:13.373
Is everything all right?

00:06:13.433 --> 00:06:14.564
Yes, thank you.

00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:16.379
Good.

00:06:16.438 --> 00:06:20.534
That's £12.50, please.

00:06:20.594 --> 00:06:21.685
What?

00:06:21.725 --> 00:06:22.335
£12.50.

00:06:22.395 --> 00:06:23.115
What for?

00:06:23.175 --> 00:06:24.166
For the chairs.

00:06:24.226 --> 00:06:25.056
The chairs?

00:06:25.116 --> 00:06:26.597
Yes.

00:06:26.657 --> 00:06:28.398
£6.25 each.

00:06:28.458 --> 00:06:30.208
There must be some mistake.

00:06:30.268 --> 00:06:30.958
Oh.

00:06:31.018 --> 00:06:33.010
Sorry.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:34.950
£6.30.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:38.872
That's £12.60 all together.

00:06:38.932 --> 00:06:40.933
And of course, £37 for the table.

00:06:40.993 --> 00:06:42.333
£37 for the table.

00:06:42.393 --> 00:06:44.982
That's er...

00:06:45.042 --> 00:06:49.582
£49.60 all together.

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:50.463
Look here.

00:06:50.523 --> 00:06:51.564
Service?

00:06:51.624 --> 00:06:53.115
Not included.

00:06:53.175 --> 00:06:54.246
Service?

00:06:54.306 --> 00:06:57.228
Would you like to pay separately or together?

00:06:57.288 --> 00:07:00.581
Look, we don't want the table or the chairs.

00:07:00.641 --> 00:07:02.683
Oh, you want to sit on the floor?

00:07:02.743 --> 00:07:05.895
No, we don't want to take them away.

00:07:05.955 --> 00:07:06.856
That's good.

00:07:06.916 --> 00:07:09.678
We don't have a takeaway service.

00:07:09.738 --> 00:07:12.590
Oh, we want to sit here and eat something.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.772
Eat something?

00:07:13.831 --> 00:07:14.763
Yes.

00:07:14.822 --> 00:07:15.809
Ah.

00:07:15.869 --> 00:07:19.006
Can we see the menu, please?

00:07:19.066 --> 00:07:23.656
Yes, there you are.

00:07:23.716 --> 00:07:27.047
It's a very small menu.

00:07:27.107 --> 00:07:29.527
It's a very small restaurant.

00:07:29.587 --> 00:07:32.478
Now, what would you like?

00:07:32.538 --> 00:07:35.299
Let's see.

00:07:35.358 --> 00:07:44.800
Egg and chips, double egg and chips, double egg and double chips.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.722
Isn't this a French restaurant?

00:07:47.782 --> 00:07:48.512
Oh, yes.

00:07:48.572 --> 00:07:49.473
Sorry.

00:07:49.533 --> 00:07:51.224
Give me the menu.

00:07:51.284 --> 00:07:52.716
Thank you.

00:07:52.775 --> 00:07:54.267
Have you got a pencil?

00:07:54.327 --> 00:07:55.488
Who are?

00:07:55.548 --> 00:08:00.372
Thank you.

00:08:00.432 --> 00:08:05.126
There.

00:08:05.186 --> 00:08:08.298
A French menu.

00:08:08.358 --> 00:08:12.220
Earth, a palm fritt.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.777
Does Earth...

00:08:13.837 --> 00:08:15.504
A palm fritt.

00:08:15.564 --> 00:08:17.314
Ders earth.

00:08:17.374 --> 00:08:20.166
A der palm fritt.

00:08:20.226 --> 00:08:22.138
What if you don't like eggs?

00:08:22.198 --> 00:08:23.149
Have the chips.

00:08:23.209 --> 00:08:24.510
What if you don't like chips?

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.390
Have the eggs.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:27.222
What if you don't like eggs or chips?

00:08:27.282 --> 00:08:28.333
Have a sandwich.

00:08:28.392 --> 00:08:29.864
A sandwich?

00:08:29.924 --> 00:08:30.725
Yes.

00:08:30.784 --> 00:08:32.035
I've got one here.

00:08:32.055 --> 00:08:34.417
In my pocket.

00:08:34.477 --> 00:08:37.249
Thank you.

00:08:37.309 --> 00:08:41.633
What's in this sandwich?

00:08:41.692 --> 00:08:43.353
Sand.

00:08:43.414 --> 00:08:44.864
And?

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.235
Yes, sand.

00:08:47.295 --> 00:08:53.806
That's why it's called a sandwich because of the sand, which is inside it.

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:56.017
Come on, let's go.

00:08:56.076 --> 00:08:57.477
What's the matter?

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.227
You're not going already, are you?

00:08:59.287 --> 00:08:59.867
Yes.

00:08:59.927 --> 00:09:00.587
Why?

00:09:00.647 --> 00:09:03.488
Because this must be the worst restaurant in London.

00:09:03.548 --> 00:09:05.208
No, it isn't.

00:09:05.268 --> 00:09:06.068
Isn't it?

00:09:06.128 --> 00:09:06.949
No.

00:09:07.009 --> 00:09:09.159
I've got another one round the corner.

00:09:09.219 --> 00:09:11.890
It's much worse than this one.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:13.220
Anyway.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.464
People don't come here for the food.

00:09:16.524 --> 00:09:17.845
I'm not surprised.

00:09:17.905 --> 00:09:18.586
No.

00:09:18.646 --> 00:09:22.080
They come here for the music.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.220
The music?

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.422
Yes.

00:09:24.482 --> 00:09:30.698
Allow me to present Manfred Schmidt and his Spanish guitar.

00:09:30.758 --> 00:09:32.740
Hi!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:38.958
Oh.

00:09:39.018 --> 00:09:44.074
Couldn't haven't made a diamond on heaven!

00:09:44.134 --> 00:09:45.914
Stavros?

00:09:45.974 --> 00:09:46.624
Yes.

00:09:46.685 --> 00:09:48.465
What can Manfred play?

00:09:48.525 --> 00:09:49.816
Anything you like?

00:09:49.876 --> 00:09:50.476
Really?

00:09:50.536 --> 00:09:51.306
Yes.

00:09:51.366 --> 00:09:53.187
Anything at all.

00:09:53.247 --> 00:09:54.147
Good.

00:09:54.207 --> 00:09:57.138
Tell him to play football.

00:09:57.198 --> 00:09:58.879
Football?

00:09:58.939 --> 00:10:00.169
What do you mean?

00:10:00.229 --> 00:10:01.490
We're leaving.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.434
Goodbye.

00:10:03.494 --> 00:10:06.308
Oh, goodbye.

00:10:06.368 --> 00:10:08.119
Do come again.

00:10:08.179 --> 00:10:12.120
Don't forget to tell your friends.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:16.170
That's a trouble with English people, Manfred.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.720
What's that, Stavros?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:26.832
They don't know a good restaurant when they see one.

00:10:26.892 --> 00:10:36.830
The Doctor.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:40.968
Hello?

00:10:41.028 --> 00:10:42.138
Doctor Watson.

00:10:42.198 --> 00:10:42.878
Yes?

00:10:42.938 --> 00:10:44.189
My name's Smith.

00:10:44.249 --> 00:10:45.529
What's the matter with you?

00:10:45.589 --> 00:10:46.559
Nothing, Doctor.

00:10:46.599 --> 00:10:47.419
I'm fine.

00:10:47.479 --> 00:10:48.280
Really?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.030
In that case, why are you calling?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.980
Well, I'm a doctor.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.350
You're a doctor?

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.131
Actually, I'm a student, Doctor.

00:10:56.191 --> 00:10:57.391
You're a student?

00:10:57.451 --> 00:10:58.311
Doctor.

00:10:58.371 --> 00:10:59.762
Yes?

00:10:59.822 --> 00:11:02.672
Er, I'm a student, Doctor.

00:11:02.732 --> 00:11:05.032
Ah, a student, Doctor.

00:11:05.092 --> 00:11:08.234
Yes, I'm studying to be a doctor, Doctor.

00:11:08.294 --> 00:11:09.826
A doctor, doctor?

00:11:09.886 --> 00:11:11.586
What's a doctor, doctor?

00:11:11.646 --> 00:11:14.358
Well, you're a doctor, doctor.

00:11:14.418 --> 00:11:15.068
Am I?

00:11:15.128 --> 00:11:15.798
Yes.

00:11:15.858 --> 00:11:17.929
And I'd like to come and watch you working.

00:11:17.989 --> 00:11:18.490
Fine.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:19.750
Well, come any time.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:22.411
Goodbye.

00:11:22.471 --> 00:11:25.642
Come in.

00:11:25.702 --> 00:11:28.154
Good morning, doctor.

00:11:28.214 --> 00:11:31.365
Ah, you must be the student doctor.

00:11:31.425 --> 00:11:32.346
Pardon?

00:11:32.406 --> 00:11:33.746
Student doctor.

00:11:33.806 --> 00:11:35.037
Student doctor.

00:11:35.097 --> 00:11:36.348
No, actually I'm...

00:11:36.408 --> 00:11:38.452
Sit down.

00:11:38.512 --> 00:11:42.888
Now, you want to watch me working?

00:11:42.948 --> 00:11:43.989
Uh, no.

00:11:44.049 --> 00:11:45.630
Actually, I'm not a...

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.591
Ah, that'll be my first patient.

00:11:48.651 --> 00:11:49.922
Come in!

00:11:49.982 --> 00:11:52.303
Good morning, Doctor.

00:11:52.363 --> 00:11:54.334
Good morning.

00:11:54.394 --> 00:11:56.535
This is a student doctor.

00:11:56.595 --> 00:11:58.426
He's come to watch me working.

00:11:58.486 --> 00:12:00.017
This is a patient.

00:12:00.077 --> 00:12:02.154
I'm going to ask her a few questions.

00:12:02.214 --> 00:12:03.021
Doctor.

