00:23:19.194 --> 00:23:21.372
Mmm.

00:23:21.432 --> 00:23:22.872
Delicious.

00:23:22.932 --> 00:23:26.033
I don't think you're taking this very seriously.

00:23:26.093 --> 00:23:27.174
Sorry, madam.

00:23:27.234 --> 00:23:29.545
Let's start at the beginning.

00:23:29.605 --> 00:23:32.286
Your husband bought these shoes.

00:23:32.346 --> 00:23:33.056
Yes.

00:23:33.116 --> 00:23:33.857
From me.

00:23:33.917 --> 00:23:34.567
Yes.

00:23:34.627 --> 00:23:36.498
And you're not satisfied with them.

00:23:36.558 --> 00:23:37.708
That's right.

00:23:37.768 --> 00:23:40.119
I'm not satisfied at all.

00:23:40.179 --> 00:23:42.270
What do you mean, exactly?

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:44.451
What do you mean, what do I mean?

00:23:44.511 --> 00:23:46.142
What do I mean, what do you mean?

00:23:46.202 --> 00:23:47.142
Yes.

00:23:47.202 --> 00:23:49.382
What I mean is this?

00:23:49.442 --> 00:23:52.135
Are you A, unhappy?

00:23:52.195 --> 00:23:54.156
B, annoyed?

00:23:54.216 --> 00:23:55.838
C, angry?

00:23:55.898 --> 00:23:58.410
or D, suicidal?

00:23:58.471 --> 00:24:01.518
Well, I'm unhappy.

00:24:01.578 --> 00:24:02.734
You're unhappy.

00:24:02.794 --> 00:24:03.534
Yes.

00:24:03.595 --> 00:24:04.816
You're not annoyed.

00:24:04.876 --> 00:24:05.666
No.

00:24:05.726 --> 00:24:08.428
Well, yes I am.

00:24:08.489 --> 00:24:09.600
So you're annoyed?

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:10.290
Yes.

00:24:10.350 --> 00:24:11.842
You're not just unhappy.

00:24:11.902 --> 00:24:12.712
You're annoyed.

00:24:12.772 --> 00:24:13.373
Yes.

00:24:13.433 --> 00:24:14.544
But you're not angry.

00:24:14.604 --> 00:24:15.074
No.

00:24:15.134 --> 00:24:15.945
You're sure?

00:24:16.005 --> 00:24:16.736
Yes.

00:24:16.796 --> 00:24:18.487
Oh, you are angry.

00:24:18.547 --> 00:24:21.218
No, I'm sure I'm not angry.

00:24:21.278 --> 00:24:22.569
You're not angry.

00:24:22.629 --> 00:24:23.950
I'm not angry.

00:24:24.010 --> 00:24:25.440
Well, you look angry to me.

00:24:25.460 --> 00:24:27.702
All right, I'm angry.

00:24:27.762 --> 00:24:30.023
You're angry, right, but not suicidal.

00:24:30.063 --> 00:24:30.983
That's right.

00:24:31.023 --> 00:24:32.074
Good, you're angry.

00:24:32.134 --> 00:24:32.524
Yes.

00:24:32.584 --> 00:24:42.769
Now, are you A, very angry, B, very, very angry, C, extremely angry, or D, absolutely furious.

00:24:42.829 --> 00:24:46.390
Look, this is stupid.

00:24:46.450 --> 00:24:48.421
Oh, it's stupid, is it?

00:24:48.481 --> 00:24:49.832
Yes, it's stupid.

00:24:49.892 --> 00:24:50.572
I see.

00:24:50.632 --> 00:24:59.405
Would you say it's A, very stupid, B, very very stupid, C, completely stupid, or D, absolutely idiotic?

00:24:59.465 --> 00:25:05.127
Look, all I want to do is change these shoes.

00:25:05.187 --> 00:25:07.118
Change the shoes.

00:25:07.178 --> 00:25:09.498
Well, why didn't you say so?

00:25:09.558 --> 00:25:17.684
You're very lucky, madam, because I have here another pair of shoes that are very similar.

00:25:17.744 --> 00:25:20.686
No, wait a minute.

00:25:20.746 --> 00:25:23.909
That's a red one and a green one as well.

00:25:23.969 --> 00:25:25.450
You're quite right.

00:25:25.510 --> 00:25:26.452
Okay.

00:25:26.512 --> 00:25:30.004
Let me change this red one for this green one.

00:25:30.064 --> 00:25:31.836
Thank you.

00:25:31.896 --> 00:25:34.506
And this green one for this red one.

00:25:34.566 --> 00:25:36.044
Satisfied?

00:25:36.104 --> 00:25:36.784
No.

00:25:36.844 --> 00:25:37.934
Alright then.

00:25:37.994 --> 00:25:41.986
I'll change this green one for this red one.

00:25:42.047 --> 00:25:44.628
And this red one for this green one.

00:25:44.688 --> 00:25:45.408
Look!

00:25:45.468 --> 00:25:46.529
Just a minute.

00:25:46.589 --> 00:25:48.910
I've got a better idea.

00:25:48.970 --> 00:25:53.462
Your husband bought this pair of shoes.

00:25:53.522 --> 00:25:57.604
So if you buy this pair as well.

00:25:57.664 --> 00:25:59.185
Yes.

00:25:59.245 --> 00:26:03.577
You can have one pair and your husband can have the other.

00:26:03.638 --> 00:26:05.992
Alright.

00:26:06.052 --> 00:26:09.309
One pear?

00:26:09.369 --> 00:26:12.020
Two pears.

00:26:12.080 --> 00:26:13.642
How much is that?

00:26:13.662 --> 00:26:14.563
£20 £20.

00:26:14.583 --> 00:26:15.163
Here you are.

00:26:15.183 --> 00:26:16.184
No, it's £20 a pear.

00:26:16.204 --> 00:26:16.665
That's £40.

00:26:16.685 --> 00:26:16.765
£40?

00:26:16.785 --> 00:26:16.965
Yes.

00:26:16.985 --> 00:26:27.426
But my husband paid you £20 yesterday.

00:26:27.486 --> 00:26:33.254
Did he?

00:26:33.314 --> 00:26:34.275
Yes.

00:26:34.335 --> 00:26:37.806
So you owe me £20.

00:26:37.866 --> 00:26:38.967
Do I?

00:26:39.027 --> 00:26:40.178
Yes.

00:26:40.238 --> 00:26:42.039
Oh.

00:26:42.099 --> 00:26:43.990
Here you are then.

00:26:44.050 --> 00:26:44.960
Thank you.

00:26:45.020 --> 00:26:46.011
Goodbye.

00:26:46.071 --> 00:26:46.691
Goodbye.

00:26:46.711 --> 00:26:48.572
Er...

00:26:48.633 --> 00:26:49.893
No.

00:26:49.953 --> 00:26:51.594
Just a minute.

00:26:51.654 --> 00:26:54.796
Come back!

00:26:54.856 --> 00:26:59.534
The Strange Hotel Splendido.

00:26:59.594 --> 00:27:01.530
Good afternoon, sir.

00:27:01.590 --> 00:27:04.682
Welcome to the Hotel Splendido.

00:27:04.742 --> 00:27:05.684
Thank you.

00:27:05.744 --> 00:27:07.314
Good heavens.

00:27:07.375 --> 00:27:08.445
Look at that.

00:27:08.505 --> 00:27:09.176
What?

00:27:09.236 --> 00:27:10.147
Look at what?

00:27:10.207 --> 00:27:11.308
Your shirt.

00:27:11.368 --> 00:27:12.118
My shirt.

00:27:12.178 --> 00:27:12.829
Yes.

00:27:12.889 --> 00:27:13.980
Do you like it?

00:27:14.040 --> 00:27:14.750
No.

00:27:14.810 --> 00:27:15.581
No.

00:27:15.641 --> 00:27:16.511
No.

00:27:16.572 --> 00:27:18.123
It's horrible.

00:27:18.183 --> 00:27:19.644
I beg your pardon.

00:27:19.704 --> 00:27:21.142
It's horrible.

00:27:21.202 --> 00:27:23.920
But for you, it's a good shirt.

00:27:23.981 --> 00:27:24.851
Thank you.

00:27:24.911 --> 00:27:28.643
Because when people look at you, they look at the shirt.

00:27:28.703 --> 00:27:29.504
I know.

00:27:29.564 --> 00:27:30.744
And that's good.

00:27:30.804 --> 00:27:34.917
Because if they look at the shirt, they don't look at the shorts.

00:27:34.977 --> 00:27:35.808
What?

00:27:35.868 --> 00:27:38.729
And the shorts are really horrible.

00:27:38.789 --> 00:27:42.652
Now listen, I didn't come here to be insulted by you.

00:27:42.712 --> 00:27:45.673
Oh, you want somebody else to do it?

00:27:45.733 --> 00:27:48.085
Hey George, come here for a minute.

00:27:48.145 --> 00:27:48.872
Stop!

00:27:48.932 --> 00:27:51.580
Look, I want to book a room.

00:27:51.640 --> 00:27:53.110
Book a room.

00:27:53.170 --> 00:27:53.830
Yes.

00:27:53.890 --> 00:27:55.080
Have you got one?

00:27:55.140 --> 00:27:55.881
What?

00:27:55.941 --> 00:27:57.561
A book or a room?

00:27:57.621 --> 00:27:58.451
A room.

00:27:58.511 --> 00:27:59.982
Have you got a room?

00:28:00.042 --> 00:28:00.772
Yes.

00:28:00.832 --> 00:28:02.392
We've got lots of rooms.

00:28:02.452 --> 00:28:04.003
It's a big hotel.

00:28:04.063 --> 00:28:04.683
Yes.

00:28:04.743 --> 00:28:06.863
But have you got a room free?

00:28:06.923 --> 00:28:07.754
Free?

00:28:07.814 --> 00:28:08.474
Yes.

00:28:08.534 --> 00:28:09.264
No.

00:28:09.324 --> 00:28:10.914
You have to pay for it.

00:28:10.974 --> 00:28:14.385
I mean, have you got a room with no one in it?

00:28:14.445 --> 00:28:15.435
I don't know.

00:28:15.495 --> 00:28:18.374
Well, can you have a look in the book?

00:28:18.434 --> 00:28:19.474
Pardon?

00:28:19.534 --> 00:28:21.385
Have a look in the book.

00:28:21.446 --> 00:28:23.027
A look in the book.

00:28:23.087 --> 00:28:24.989
Yes, have a look in the book.

00:28:25.049 --> 00:28:28.892
OK.

00:28:28.952 --> 00:28:34.788
OK, I've had a look in the book.

00:28:34.848 --> 00:28:36.219
And what do you think?

00:28:36.279 --> 00:28:37.560
It's a nice book.

00:28:37.620 --> 00:28:38.310
Look!

00:28:38.370 --> 00:28:40.693
Have you got a room or haven't you?

00:28:40.753 --> 00:28:43.633
OK, OK, OK.

00:28:43.693 --> 00:28:47.053
Yes, we've got a room.

00:28:47.113 --> 00:28:47.684
Good.

00:28:47.744 --> 00:28:49.095
A single room.

00:28:49.155 --> 00:28:50.166
No, good.

00:28:50.226 --> 00:28:51.576
I need a double room.

00:28:51.636 --> 00:28:52.538
Ah, yes.

00:28:52.598 --> 00:28:54.959
For you and your shirt.

00:28:54.979 --> 00:28:55.230
No.

00:28:55.290 --> 00:28:57.091
For me and my wife.

00:28:57.151 --> 00:28:58.992
She's arriving this evening.

00:28:59.052 --> 00:29:00.914
Ah.

00:29:00.974 --> 00:29:04.086
Yes, we've got a double room.

00:29:04.146 --> 00:29:04.856
Good.

00:29:04.916 --> 00:29:06.117
How much is it?

00:29:06.178 --> 00:29:07.128
How much?

00:29:07.188 --> 00:29:08.017
Yes.

00:29:08.077 --> 00:29:14.593
It's about this long, and about this wide, and about this high.

00:29:14.613 --> 00:29:14.914
No!

00:29:14.974 --> 00:29:17.968
Not how big, how much?

00:29:18.028 --> 00:29:18.908
Ah!

00:29:18.968 --> 00:29:20.390
Ten pounds.

00:29:20.450 --> 00:29:21.442
Ten pounds?

00:29:21.502 --> 00:29:22.186
Yes.

00:29:22.246 --> 00:29:28.904
Ten pounds for you, ten pounds for your wife, and fifty pounds for the horrible shirt.

00:29:28.964 --> 00:29:32.416
Fifty pounds for the shirt, that's ridiculous.

00:29:32.476 --> 00:29:34.157
It's a ridiculous shirt.

00:29:34.217 --> 00:29:35.718
Now, you listen to me.

00:29:35.778 --> 00:29:37.509
I don't like your attitude.

00:29:37.569 --> 00:29:39.230
I don't like your shirt.

00:29:39.290 --> 00:29:41.272
I'm going to complain to the manager.

00:29:41.332 --> 00:29:42.762
She's not here.

00:29:42.822 --> 00:29:43.993
Where is she?

00:29:44.054 --> 00:29:45.464
In hospital.

00:29:45.524 --> 00:29:46.925
In hospital?

00:29:46.985 --> 00:29:48.196
Oh dear.

00:29:48.256 --> 00:29:49.927
Did she have an accident?

00:29:49.987 --> 00:29:51.488
Not exactly.

00:29:51.548 --> 00:29:53.638
She had dinner in the hotel.

00:29:53.698 --> 00:30:02.972
Well, I would just like to say that you are the most unhelpful, the most unpleasant, the worst receptionist that I have met in my life.

00:30:03.032 --> 00:30:04.713
Thank you very much.

00:30:04.773 --> 00:30:07.214
And I am going to report you to the manager.

00:30:07.274 --> 00:30:08.154
Fine.

00:30:08.214 --> 00:30:10.445
Shall I give you the phone number of the hospital?

00:30:10.505 --> 00:30:12.066
Right, that's enough.

00:30:12.126 --> 00:30:15.207
My wife and I are not going to stay at this hotel.

00:30:15.267 --> 00:30:17.708
I'll go and book a room at the hotel next door.

00:30:17.768 --> 00:30:19.429
Okay, see you there.

00:30:19.489 --> 00:30:20.299
Pardon?

00:30:20.359 --> 00:30:21.700
I'll see you there.

00:30:21.760 --> 00:30:22.610
What?

00:30:22.670 --> 00:30:25.932
This is my last day at this hotel.

00:30:25.992 --> 00:30:28.013
I lost my job this morning.

00:30:28.073 --> 00:30:31.884
I start work tomorrow at the hotel next door.

00:30:31.944 --> 00:30:33.025
Oh no.

00:30:33.085 --> 00:30:34.165
See you tomorrow.

00:30:34.185 --> 00:30:44.386
A ticket to Birmingham.

00:30:44.446 --> 00:30:49.666
Excuse me.

00:30:49.726 --> 00:30:51.176
Can I help you?

00:30:51.236 --> 00:30:52.918
Yes.

00:30:52.978 --> 00:30:56.000
I want a ticket.

00:30:56.060 --> 00:30:57.970
A ticket?

00:30:58.030 --> 00:30:58.771
Yes.

00:30:58.831 --> 00:31:00.592
I want a ticket to Birmingham.

00:31:00.652 --> 00:31:02.523
A ticket to Birmingham?

00:31:02.583 --> 00:31:03.504
Yes.

00:31:03.564 --> 00:31:04.814
Why?

00:31:04.874 --> 00:31:05.804
Why what?

00:31:05.865 --> 00:31:07.916
Why do you want a ticket to Birmingham?

00:31:07.976 --> 00:31:10.817
Well, Birmingham's a terrible place.

00:31:10.878 --> 00:31:11.999
It's awful.

00:31:12.059 --> 00:31:14.281
If I were you, I wouldn't go to Birmingham.

00:31:14.341 --> 00:31:15.092
I live there.

00:31:15.152 --> 00:31:17.283
Now, Oxford's a very nice place.

00:31:17.343 --> 00:31:18.334
I live there.

00:31:18.394 --> 00:31:19.894
Why don't you go to Oxford?

00:31:19.954 --> 00:31:21.415
I live there.

00:31:21.475 --> 00:31:22.136
What?

00:31:22.196 --> 00:31:22.896
In Oxford?

00:31:22.956 --> 00:31:24.657
No, in Birmingham.

00:31:24.717 --> 00:31:25.278
Oh.

00:31:25.338 --> 00:31:27.919
And I want to go to Birmingham.

00:31:27.979 --> 00:31:29.020
Today.

00:31:29.080 --> 00:31:30.310
Impossible.

00:31:30.370 --> 00:31:31.301
What?

00:31:31.361 --> 00:31:33.124
It's impossible.

00:31:33.184 --> 00:31:35.086
It'll take you three days.

00:31:35.146 --> 00:31:36.298
Three days?

00:31:36.358 --> 00:31:37.178
Oh, yes.

00:31:37.238 --> 00:31:39.390
It'll take you at least three days.

00:31:39.450 --> 00:31:40.241
Walking.

00:31:40.301 --> 00:31:41.292
Walking?

00:31:41.352 --> 00:31:43.564
I don't want to walk to Birmingham.

00:31:43.624 --> 00:31:44.695
You don't want to walk?

00:31:44.755 --> 00:31:45.486
No.

00:31:45.546 --> 00:31:47.327
Oh, I understand.

00:31:47.387 --> 00:31:47.908
Good.

00:31:47.968 --> 00:31:48.928
You want to run?

00:31:48.988 --> 00:31:49.499
Run?

00:31:49.559 --> 00:31:51.771
You'll get very tired if you run.

00:31:51.831 --> 00:31:52.612
Listen.

00:31:52.632 --> 00:31:54.653
If I were you, I'd walk.

00:31:54.713 --> 00:31:56.134
I don't want to walk.

00:31:56.194 --> 00:31:57.936
And I don't want to run.

00:31:57.996 --> 00:32:00.128
I want to take the train.

00:32:00.188 --> 00:32:01.716
The train?

00:32:01.776 --> 00:32:04.595
You'll get there much faster if you walk.

00:32:04.655 --> 00:32:06.306
Now, don't be ridiculous.

00:32:06.366 --> 00:32:08.818
I want a ticket for the next train to Birmingham.

00:32:08.878 --> 00:32:10.550
The next train to Birmingham?

00:32:10.610 --> 00:32:11.080
Yes.

00:32:11.140 --> 00:32:12.041
When is it?

00:32:12.101 --> 00:32:12.962
Pardon?

00:32:13.022 --> 00:32:14.403
What time is it?

00:32:14.463 --> 00:32:15.624
I don't know.

00:32:15.684 --> 00:32:16.965
I haven't got to watch.

00:32:17.025 --> 00:32:19.778
No, I mean, what time is the train?

00:32:19.837 --> 00:32:22.410
What time does the train leave?

00:32:22.470 --> 00:32:24.552
Oh, I see.

00:32:24.612 --> 00:32:25.952
Sorry.

00:32:26.012 --> 00:32:27.804
I'll check.

00:32:27.864 --> 00:32:29.536
Take a seat.

00:32:29.596 --> 00:32:34.794
Thank you.

00:32:34.854 --> 00:32:40.042
Hello?

00:32:40.102 --> 00:32:41.274
Bert?

00:32:41.334 --> 00:32:42.814
Who's that?

00:32:42.874 --> 00:32:44.706
Oh, hello, Charlie.

00:32:44.766 --> 00:32:46.336
Where's Bert?

00:32:46.396 --> 00:32:47.177
Is he?

00:32:47.197 --> 00:32:51.019
Oh, well, erm...

00:32:51.039 --> 00:32:53.591
Is Eric there?

00:32:53.651 --> 00:32:55.942
Hello?

00:32:56.002 --> 00:32:57.003
Eric?

00:32:57.063 --> 00:32:59.424
Isn't Bert there?

00:32:59.484 --> 00:33:02.176
Oh, dear.

00:33:02.236 --> 00:33:04.298
Very sad.

00:33:04.358 --> 00:33:05.868
Erm...

00:33:05.928 --> 00:33:09.080
He's after there.

00:33:09.140 --> 00:33:12.090
Hello, Arthur.

00:33:12.150 --> 00:33:13.380
Who?

00:33:13.440 --> 00:33:15.471
Oh, hello, Charlie.

00:33:15.531 --> 00:33:16.991
Is Bert there?

00:33:17.051 --> 00:33:21.132
Look, can you please find out when the next train to Birmingham leaves?

00:33:21.192 --> 00:33:22.992
Yes, all right.

00:33:23.052 --> 00:33:25.052
Uh, Charlie?

00:33:25.113 --> 00:33:26.433
Who's that?

00:33:26.493 --> 00:33:28.013
Harry?

00:33:28.073 --> 00:33:30.124
Oh, Arthur.

00:33:30.184 --> 00:33:32.564
Can I speak to Dave?

00:33:32.624 --> 00:33:34.694
Yes, OK, I'll hold on.

00:33:34.754 --> 00:33:36.585
Look, it's all right.

00:33:36.645 --> 00:33:38.075
I'm holding on.

00:33:38.135 --> 00:33:39.777
Dave?

00:33:39.837 --> 00:33:41.329
Hello, Dave.

00:33:41.389 --> 00:33:42.820
This is Sid.

00:33:42.880 --> 00:33:45.612
Very well, thanks, and you?

00:33:45.672 --> 00:33:47.272
Good.

00:33:47.332 --> 00:33:48.913
Listen, Dave.

00:33:48.973 --> 00:33:51.934
There's something I must ask you.

00:33:51.994 --> 00:33:54.936
How's your wife?

00:33:54.996 --> 00:33:56.796
Did she?

00:33:56.856 --> 00:33:59.237
The next train to Birmingham.

00:33:59.297 --> 00:34:00.698
Oh, yes.

00:34:00.758 --> 00:34:05.380
Dave, I've got a young man here.

00:34:05.440 --> 00:34:08.992
When is the next train to Birmingham?

00:34:09.052 --> 00:34:10.818
Yes.

00:34:10.878 --> 00:34:12.664
Yes.

00:34:12.724 --> 00:34:14.165
Yes.

00:34:14.225 --> 00:34:15.486
