00:58:43.725 --> 00:58:46.126
You'll sell the vacuum cleaner to me.

00:58:46.186 --> 00:58:47.058
Yes.

00:58:47.118 --> 00:58:50.250
OK, but it isn't as easy as you think.

00:58:50.310 --> 00:58:51.701
We'll see.

00:58:51.761 --> 00:58:54.233
Go inside and shut the door.

00:58:54.253 --> 00:58:58.566
All right.

00:58:58.626 --> 00:59:04.856
Not today, thank you.

00:59:04.916 --> 00:59:08.062
Yes?

00:59:08.122 --> 00:59:09.293
Hello.

00:59:09.353 --> 00:59:10.243
Hello.

00:59:10.303 --> 00:59:12.144
My goodness me.

00:59:12.204 --> 00:59:15.064
What a beautiful house you've got.

00:59:15.124 --> 00:59:16.875
