00:59:16.895 --> 00:59:17.736
I like it.

00:59:17.796 --> 00:59:22.067
It's the most beautiful house I've seen for a long time.

00:59:22.127 --> 00:59:23.207
Thank you very much.

00:59:23.267 --> 00:59:24.288
