00:59:24.348 --> 00:59:25.646
Thank you.

00:59:25.706 --> 00:59:28.656
What a colourful carpet.

00:59:28.716 --> 00:59:30.928
Yes, it's lovely isn't it?

00:59:30.988 --> 00:59:34.359
It's the most colourful carpet I've seen for ages.

00:59:34.419 --> 00:59:37.021
I should think it was very expensive.

00:59:37.081 --> 00:59:39.172
The most expensive one in the shop.

00:59:39.232 --> 00:59:43.504
And I suppose you've got a very good vacuum cleaner to look after it.

00:59:43.524 --> 00:59:45.665
I have vacuum cleaner.

00:59:45.726 --> 00:59:47.686
No, I haven't.

00:59:47.746 --> 00:59:50.538
You haven't got a vacuum cleaner.

00:59:50.598 --> 00:59:51.408
No.

00:59:51.468 --> 01:00:03.897
Well, madam, this is your lucky day because I have here the best vacuum cleaner that money can buy the superlative vacuum cleaner.

01:00:03.957 --> 01:00:05.398
