01:00:05.458 --> 01:00:06.348
Good.

01:00:06.408 --> 01:00:07.659
Good.

01:00:07.720 --> 01:00:10.069
It's the...

01:00:10.129 --> 01:00:11.387
The quickest?

01:00:11.447 --> 01:00:14.158
The quickest, the...

01:00:14.218 --> 01:00:15.059
Cleanest?

01:00:15.119 --> 01:00:27.224
The cleanest, the cheapest, the smallest, the smartest, the most economical, the most effective, the most beautiful, the most revolutionary vacuum cleaner in the world.

01:00:27.284 --> 01:00:28.334
Ooh!

01:00:28.394 --> 01:00:29.605
How much is it?

01:00:29.665 --> 01:00:31.926
Just £65 to you, madam.

01:00:31.986 --> 01:00:33.357
Oh, barley!

01:00:33.417 --> 01:00:34.838
Good.

01:00:34.898 --> 01:00:36.643
Where's the money?

01:00:36.704 --> 01:00:39.950
Oh, it's in my handbag on the kitchen table.

01:00:40.010 --> 01:00:41.140
Oh, right.

01:00:41.200 --> 01:00:43.211
Oh, just go and get some money.

01:00:43.271 --> 01:00:44.441
Good idea, madam.

01:00:44.501 --> 01:00:46.492
You've made the right decision.

01:00:46.552 --> 01:00:47.912
Do you know?

01:00:47.972 --> 01:00:50.082
You're a fantastic saleswoman.

01:00:50.142 --> 01:00:50.983
Oh.

01:00:51.043 --> 01:00:53.633
You've got a fantastic sales technique.

01:00:53.693 --> 01:00:54.784
Do you think so?

01:00:54.844 --> 01:00:55.334
Yes.

01:00:55.394 --> 01:00:58.255
You've got the best sales technique I've seen all day.

01:00:58.315 --> 01:00:59.255
Thank you.

01:00:59.315 --> 01:01:00.585
Thank you, madam.

01:01:00.605 --> 01:01:04.152
Hmm.

01:01:04.212 --> 01:01:12.486
10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 65.

01:01:12.546 --> 01:01:23.641
Now that's the way to sell a vacuum cleaner.

01:01:23.701 --> 01:01:34.104
Hmm, three o'clock.

01:01:34.164 --> 01:01:36.084
Where is he?

01:01:36.144 --> 01:01:38.514
Ah, there he is.

01:01:38.574 --> 01:01:39.684
Jerry!

01:01:39.745 --> 01:01:40.855
Jerry!

01:01:40.875 --> 01:01:43.145
Ah, hello!

01:01:43.205 --> 01:01:45.266
Hello, Jerry.

01:01:45.326 --> 01:01:48.826
Well, the big day, eh?

01:01:48.886 --> 01:01:50.476
Yes, my driving test.

01:01:50.536 --> 01:01:53.047
