01:01:53.107 --> 01:01:54.457
Oh, that's all right, Jerry.

01:01:54.517 --> 01:01:56.417
You have had driving lessons, haven't you?

01:01:56.477 --> 01:01:57.697
Oh, yes.

01:01:57.758 --> 01:02:00.856
Well, I had one.

01:02:00.917 --> 01:02:01.645
One?

01:02:01.705 --> 01:02:02.346
Yes.

01:02:02.406 --> 01:02:03.887
I had one last night.

01:02:03.947 --> 01:02:05.158
It was very good.

01:02:05.218 --> 01:02:06.358
That's not enough.

01:02:06.418 --> 01:02:07.740
You should have had at least ten.

01:02:07.780 --> 01:02:08.790
No, don't worry.

01:02:08.850 --> 01:02:10.221
I've flown aeroplanes, you know.

01:02:10.241 --> 01:02:12.143
And it's all more or less the same.

01:02:12.163 --> 01:02:14.745
We'll just jump in and switch on and hop.

01:02:14.805 --> 01:02:15.405
