01:02:15.465 --> 01:02:16.906
Yes, but this isn't an aeroplane.

01:02:16.926 --> 01:02:17.897
It's a car.

01:02:17.957 --> 01:02:19.078
My car.

01:02:19.138 --> 01:02:19.608
Oh, yes.

01:02:19.668 --> 01:02:21.059
I can see that.

01:02:21.119 --> 01:02:22.214
Hmm.

01:02:22.274 --> 01:02:23.760
That's another problem.

01:02:23.820 --> 01:02:24.340
What?

01:02:24.400 --> 01:02:25.462
Your eyes.

01:02:25.522 --> 01:02:27.043
What's the matter with my eyes?

01:02:27.103 --> 01:02:29.045
Well, they're not exactly perfect, are they?

01:02:29.105 --> 01:02:30.457
Well, I know.

01:02:30.517 --> 01:02:31.898
I can't see very well.

01:02:31.958 --> 01:02:35.662
But you told the authorities that your eyes were perfect.

01:02:35.722 --> 01:02:36.923
You shouldn't have done that.

01:02:36.983 --> 01:02:37.954
Yes, I know.

01:02:37.974 --> 01:02:39.215
But don't worry.

01:02:39.275 --> 01:02:40.676
Everything will be all right.

01:02:40.736 --> 01:02:43.369
I borrowed these glasses from my uncle.

01:02:43.429 --> 01:02:45.421
And he says they're marvellous.

01:02:45.481 --> 01:02:47.845
Your uncle's glasses?

01:02:47.905 --> 01:02:50.838
But Jerry, you should have brought your own glasses.

01:02:50.898 --> 01:02:53.329
I haven't got any of my own, but don't worry.

01:02:53.389 --> 01:02:57.500
My uncle has worn these for 25 years, and he's a brain surgeon.

01:02:57.560 --> 01:02:58.091
Jerry.

01:02:58.131 --> 01:03:00.672
Hey, look, I'll, um, I'll put them on.

01:03:00.732 --> 01:03:02.302
There.

01:03:02.362 --> 01:03:03.633
Oh.

01:03:03.693 --> 01:03:05.813
Um, Brian.

01:03:05.874 --> 01:03:07.194
Brian.

01:03:07.254 --> 01:03:09.085
Oh!

01:03:09.145 --> 01:03:10.145
Jerry, look.

01:03:10.205 --> 01:03:11.276
Here comes the examiner.

01:03:11.336 --> 01:03:12.526
Oh, yes, I see.

01:03:12.586 --> 01:03:14.187
He looks like a very nice man.

01:03:14.247 --> 01:03:15.217
Jerry, it's not a man.

01:03:15.277 --> 01:03:15.977
It's a woman.

01:03:16.037 --> 01:03:16.487
Oh.

01:03:16.548 --> 01:03:17.774
Now, listen, Jerry.

01:03:17.834 --> 01:03:20.426
There's only one way you can pass this test.

01:03:20.486 --> 01:03:21.400
Yes?

01:03:21.460 --> 01:03:22.844
Be polite.

01:03:22.904 --> 01:03:23.315
Be polite.

01:03:23.376 --> 01:03:24.529
I'm not charity.

01:03:24.589 --> 01:03:25.723
Yes, she is.

01:03:25.783 --> 01:03:27.528
Mr. Brongh?

01:03:27.589 --> 01:03:28.502
Yes?

01:03:28.522 --> 01:03:29.515
I'm examiner.

01:03:29.575 --> 01:03:30.528
Shall we get in?

